When you are dealt a blow that reduces your life by at least [16%, 12%, 11%, 9%, 8% (TL1-5)], you have a [47%, 52%, 56%, 58%, 60% (TL1-5; SP 100)] chance to reduce the remaining cooldown of all your talents by 1.

Temporary life from Sanguine Infusion will not count against the damage threshold.

The chance will increase with your Spellpower.
